{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Dress the Duel&quot; is a roguelike deckbuilding game where your cards are your wardrobe and your outfit is your arsenal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a versatile wardrobe, <strong>disrobe</strong> strategically, <strong>layer</strong> outfits for powerful effects, and <strong>Dress</strong> the Duel!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Wardrobe-based card system: Your deck is your closet!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Strategic layering mechanics: Combine up to four layers for maximum effect</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Tactical disrobing: Remove layers of clothing for powerful bonuses or to counter enemy attacks </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Dynamic dress-up system: Watch your avatar change with every card played</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Synergistic outfit combinations: Discover powerful interactions between costumes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Roguelike deckbuilding: Expand your wardrobe as you progress through each run</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3227040?t=1769788635","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3227040?t=1769788635","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227040/06a6b81fbfaafc43c942148e70e608da7658516b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769788635","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227040/06a6b81fbfaafc43c942148e70e608da7658516b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769788635","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Dress the Due